WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.090
A spent rocket.

00:01.781 --> 00:05.634
The last stage of a rocket often stays in orbit after its job is done.

00:06.114 --> 00:08.304
About two thousand of them are up here now.

00:08.812 --> 00:16.406
In all, some forty-seven thousand objects are tracked, and by Europe's estimate more than a million pieces are too small to track.
